{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Arthur–Selberg 迹公式"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Arthur–Selberg 迹公式”"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p>A key tool in the study of automorphic forms is the Arthur-Selberg trace formula, which expressed <strong>spectral quantities</strong> (traces on representations) in terms of <strong>geometric quantities</strong> (orbital integrals). — 恽之伟, Hitchin-type moduli spaces in automorphic representation theory</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>[Hitchin 模叠](Hitchin 模叠.md)</p>\n"}}